Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:08:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/24] Fix raw KV retrieve lifetime and extend XPU pipeline
 timing

Keep the server-side retrieve read reservation until GPU scatter and device synchronization complete whenever any group consumes raw shared-memory chunks. Quantized-only groups still release their slots after decode, preserving early reuse of compact slots.

Add a regression test that overwrites the retrieved source on commit and verifies unquantized KV reaches the destination before the source can be reused.

Extend the XPU first-transfer timing test with per-thread request attribution, async gather and event wait timing, and an optional pipeline mode that submits overlapping requests before awaiting their futures.
