From 166b9222d99970455a4222f689a1b0f8c497b357 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jilongw <jilong.wang@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:10:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/24] Add regression tests for two-plane Mamba sub-states
 crossing the plane boundary

Every existing two-plane fixture placed each sub-state's byte range
entirely within one plane or exactly at the boundary, so
split_mamba_chunk's/merge_mamba_chunk's boundary-straddling while-loop
iteration never ran more than once. Add coverage for a sub-state that
spans both planes, including the pool-scratch out= paths production
store actually uses.
---
 tests/v1/multiprocess/test_mamba_quant.py | 75 +++++++++++++++++++++++
